(7224374, 1115254, 174999, '<td valign="top">hehehehe this made me giggle.. rather play with the weeds than the playground equipment, Love the expression of the girl with the closed eyes, that is just precious.. very time moment capturing and last minute, if you planned them to do this, it was very good and perfect timing, if it was just off the cuff and just watching, you captured it! My kind of portrait photos, never posed.. I like the small vignette around these too. How can you not get a high score on this one?!</td>', 'hehehehe this made me giggle.. rather play with the weeds than the playground equipment, Love the expression of the girl with the closed eyes, that is just precious.. very time moment capturing and last minute, if you planned them to do this, it was very good and perfect timing, if it was just off the cuff and just watching, you captured it! My kind of portrait photos, never posed.. I like the small vignette around these too. How can you not get a high score on this one?!', '2014-06-04 08:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
