(7225961, 1115375, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment captured, although I would''ve preferred to see more of a defined silhouette that''s not so conflicting with the tree''s silhouette.</td>', 'Beautiful moment captured, although I would''ve preferred to see more of a defined silhouette that''s not so conflicting with the tree''s silhouette.', '2014-06-08 20:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
