(7228970, 1115531, 175207, '<td valign="top">You know the worst problem for digital picture contest is everyone''s monitor is calibrated differently. I have the trouble even in my own house. I work on a computer and think it looks good then look at it on another machine and think oh god...</td>', 'You know the worst problem for digital picture contest is everyone''s monitor is calibrated differently. I have the trouble even in my own house. I work on a computer and think it looks good then look at it on another machine and think oh god...', '2014-06-15 03:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
